      "narration_text": "Annyeong — this is Liam, in for Bear. Today's ask: a live Vercel site needs cleaning up. Who does it — Claude Code, or Cowork? That's the wrong question. The right question is which execution environment owns which half of the job. Get that split right and the refactor is boring, in the best way.",
