    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "I — The Split",
      "narration_text": "Cowork is the opposite shape: a remote agent in an isolated environment. It keeps working after you close the laptop, reaches your files and browser through the desktop app, and speaks to Drive, SharePoint, and email through connectors. Outcome-oriented, not repo-centric.",
