      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "I — The Split",
      "narration_text": "One update to the old folk wisdom: the boundary is no longer code versus visual. Claude Code has a browser now — a preview pane in the desktop app, and Claude in Chrome for real click-through verification. Visual QA stopped being Cowork's exclusive territory.",
