    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "II — The Map",
      "narration_text": "Act two. Before anyone edits anything: the map. A Next.js app is full of boundaries that carry runtime meaning — and a cleanup that ignores them breaks things without an obvious diff.",
