      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "II — The Map",
      "narration_text": "The opening move is plan mode. Claude reads files and runs exploration commands but edits nothing until you approve the plan. Reconnaissance and execution get separated by a gate you control — no prompt gymnastics required.",
