    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "II — The Map",
      "narration_text": "Here's the silent failure. One casual use-client on the wrong component, one Node-only import in an edge path, one fetch moved out of its caching layer — and behavior changes while the diff looks like housekeeping. Style-only refactors are how production breaks politely.",
      "new_visual_element": "The invisible-diff failure mode",
