    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "II — The Map",
      "narration_text": "And a 2026 wrinkle: in Next sixteen, middleware was renamed proxy, and next lint is gone entirely. An audit that greps for yesterday's filenames misses today's routing truth. Check proxy dot t-s, legacy middleware, the config rewrites, and vercel dot json.",
      "new_visual_element": "Next 16 renames — audit both names",
      "shot": {
