    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "II — The Map",
      "narration_text": "For big repos, scope is the safety feature: per-directory CLAUDE dot em-dee files, deny rules on generated code, and worktrees so each session gets its own branch-backed checkout. The agent only loads the conventions for the part of the tree it touches.",
