    {
      "beat_id": "B11",
      "act": "III — The Gate",
      "narration_text": "Because next lint is gone, the gate has to be explicit — four commands, run in order: ESLint through the CLI. TypeScript with no-emit. The tests for the area you touched. And a full production build. A phase that hasn't passed all four hasn't happened.",
      "new_visual_element": "The four-command verification gate",
