    {
      "beat_id": "B12",
      "act": "III — The Gate",
      "narration_text": "One more layer of honesty: local Next is not Vercel. If the refactor touches request-time behavior, pull the project's environment down with vercel pull, and rehearse with vercel dev. Environment drift is a bug you can subtract before it exists.",
