    {
      "beat_id": "B13",
      "act": "IV — Preview First",
      "narration_text": "Act four. Vercel already assumes the workflow you want: push a branch, get a preview deployment with its own URL. The platform stages every change in a live setting before production is ever at risk. Lean into that — never skip from local edits to main.",
