      "beat_id": "B15",
      "act": "IV — Preview First",
      "narration_text": "And the trap nobody budgets for: protected previews. If the preview URL sits behind authentication and you point an agent at it, the agent faithfully verifies your login wall. Give it a deliberate path in — a bypass built for automation — or the QA report is fiction.",
