      "act": "V — Where Cowork Leads",
      "narration_text": "Act five. Now Cowork earns its half. Hand it the production URL, the preview URL, and a bounded checklist of pages and flows. It clicks through both, collects the screenshots, and comes back with evidence — while your terminal session doesn't even need to be open.",
